# MANDATORY STOP POINTS V1.5.0

> **Core Principle**: STOP. PRESENT. WAIT. PROCEED ONLY ON EXPLICIT APPROVAL.
> **Full workflow**: See `@00_Phase_Orchestration.mdc`

---

## CORE PRINCIPLE: STOP AND WAIT

At EVERY checkpoint:
1. **STOP** all generative work
2. **PRESENT** phase summary + artifacts created
3. **WAIT** for explicit user response
4. **ONLY** proceed on approval

---

## 13 MANDATORY STOP POINTS (9 phases; Phase 4 has 3 sub-stops; Phase 5 has variable per-persona sub-stops)

| # | Phase | Stop Trigger | Present | Wait For |
|---|-------|--------------|---------|----------|
| 1 | 0 — Intake | Use case parsed, forensic protocol complete | Use case summary + personas + gaps | "approved" / "adjust" |
| 2 | 1 — Problem Deep-Dive | All 5 problem themes answered or marked | Problem statement with citations | "approved" / "revise" |
| 3 | 2 — Capability Discovery + Live Research | Current state captured across 5 layers + research_log.md written | Current-state snapshot + research summary | "approved" / "more detail on X" |
| 4 | 3 — Brainstorming | 3 branches + tradeoff matrix produced | Options + recommendation | Branch selection or hybridization request |
| 5 | **4A — Feasibility Validation** | 8-dim matrix scored for every finalist capability; verdicts assigned | Feasibility matrix summary + blockers + conditionals | "approved" / "revise {capability}" / "remove {capability}" |
| 6 | **4B — Coverage Matrix** | Bidirectional matrix built; future-enabler ratio computed; uncovered pains identified | Coverage summary (M/M coverage, FE ratio, gaps) | "approved" / "revise" / "de-scope {pain}" |
| 7 | **4C — KPI Definition** | 3-tier KPI table with baselines + targets + windows + owners | KPI table summary + pre-launch baseline list | "approved" / "revise" / "add KPI" |
| 8 | 4 (overall) — Finalization | All 3 sub-stops approved; decision log + "your ask" drafted | Final decision log + traceability summary | "approved" / "modify decision X" |
| 9 | **5 — Per-Persona Refinement (variable count)** | All 5 tiers asked + answered + verified for current persona; opportunities logged | Persona name + 5 Q/A summary + verdicts (KEEP/IMPROVE/DISCARD) + new improvement count | "approved" (proceed to next persona) / "revise verdict {tier}" / "lock now {1-line rationale}" |
| 10 | **5 — Final Consolidation** | All personas processed (or `lock now`); Solution v2 diff generated; Phase 4 deltas reconciled | v1→v2 diff summary + improvement count + Phase 4 delta verdicts + termination trigger | "approved" (proceed to Phase 6) / "more rounds" / "revert {opportunity}" |
| 11 | 6 — HLD | Skeleton + 6 section groups appended (incl. §6.5 Coverage + §11 KPIs from v2); RGV passed | File path + section summary | "approved" / section-specific revisions |
| 12 | 7 — Supporting Doc | Skeleton + 6 section groups (incl. §3.5 Feasibility + §4.5 NFR + §10 Measurement + Appendix A + Appendix B Refinement Summary); KPI Baselines artifact; RGV passed | File path + section summary | "approved" / section-specific revisions |
| 13 | 8 — Panel Prep | Q&A bank + objection handlers + follow-ups produced | File path + summary | Run complete confirmation |

