## CHECKPOINT PRESENTATION FORMAT

```
🛑 CHECKPOINT {N} — Phase {N}: {Name}

**Status:** {what was produced}
**Evidence citations:** {count} customer facts cited / {total} decisions
**Assumptions flagged:** {count} ⚠️ ASSUMPTION entries
**Gaps logged:** {count} GAP-N entries
**File(s) written:** {paths if applicable}

**Summary:**
{1-5 line summary — never dump full file content}

→ "approved" to proceed to Phase {N+1}
→ "revise {specific}" to re-enter current phase
→ "stop" to pause the run

Waiting for your decision...
```

