## SELF-CHECK (RUN BEFORE EVERY CHECKPOINT)

**Universal:**
- [ ] Did I produce a `<thinking>` block for this phase?
- [ ] Is my confidence calibrated (HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW stated)?
- [ ] Is every recommendation cited with a customer fact, or marked `⚠️ ASSUMPTION`?
- [ ] Did RGV counts match (X processed == Y expected)?
- [ ] Am I using the `edit` / `multi_edit` / `write_to_file` tools (not `sed` / `cat >>`)?
- [ ] Have I flagged preview/beta capabilities with `⚠️ PREVIEW`?
- [ ] Am I about to use a forbidden phrase? (see FORBIDDEN PHRASES table)
- [ ] User pushback received? → Re-check evidence, do NOT auto-reverse (Anti-Sycophancy)
- [ ] Multi-page brief? → Sampled middle sections (Positional Bias)
- [ ] Numbers cited from customer facts? → Cite (Numerical)
- [ ] Every capability traces to customer fact or research? → Verify (Specification Gaming)
- [ ] Started with sycophantic praise? → Remove and use neutral acknowledgment

**Phase 3 Brainstorming:**
- [ ] Did I present at least 2 alternative branches?

**Phase 4A Feasibility Gate:**
- [ ] Every finalist capability scored on **all 8** dimensions (no skipped dimensions)?
- [ ] Every cell has a citation (research_log entry, customer fact, capability catalog row, or `⚠️ ASSUMPTION`)?
- [ ] Every NO-GO has a proposed alternative or explicit descope?
- [ ] Every CONDITIONAL has a validation path logged?

**Phase 4B Coverage Gate:**
- [ ] Bidirectional matrix built (pain → component AND component → pain)?
- [ ] Coverage = M/M (every Phase 1 pain has ≥1 addressing component)?
- [ ] Future-enabler ratio ≤ 20% (project standard cap)?
- [ ] No solution-without-problem components (or explicit justification)?

**Phase 4C KPI Gate:**
- [ ] 3-tier KPI table populated (Business / Operational / Technical)?
- [ ] Every KPI has Baseline + Target + Window + Owner + Instrumentation?
- [ ] Targets traced to customer ambition (not invented)?
- [ ] Pre-launch baseline capture list compiled?

**Phase 5 Per-Persona Refinement:**
- [ ] All 5 tiers asked (no tier skipped, in order)?
- [ ] Each verification cross-references catalog OR research_log OR customer fact?
- [ ] Live research triggered only when claim uncertainty existed (not gratuitously)?
- [ ] Every IMPROVE has Improvement Opportunity Schema fields populated (spec §4)?
- [ ] Every DISCARD has rationale + deferral target (Risk Register / Roadmap H3 / Out-of-scope)?
- [ ] Phase 4 delta re-validation triggered iff component/capability/KPI changed (per spec §8)?
- [ ] **Per-persona round ≤ 30 lines** (5 Q × 6 lines: Q + A + Verification 1-line + Confidence + Verdict + OPP-id)? No "Alternative considered" sub-paragraphs.

**Phase 5 Final Consolidation:**
- [ ] All scheduled personas engaged (or `lock now` with rationale captured)?
- [ ] Solution v2 diff is reconcilable to v1 (every Δ traces to OPP-id)?
- [ ] Round count ≤ 2?
- [ ] All deferred opportunities pushed to Risk Register / Roadmap / Out-of-scope?
- [ ] `terminationTrigger` set in state file (type + rationale + lockedAt)?

